---
import MainLayout from '@layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Bloomaut | Jose Vigil"
  description="Human creativity amplified through collaborative AI workflows — a community platform for honest peer feedback before you publish."
  image="../images/josevigil_400x400.png"
>
  <section>
    <div class="section-label">
      <span class="sec-num">§</span>Systems · Bloomaut
    </div>

    <div class="project-hero reveal">
      <h1 class="sec-h2">Bloomaut</h1>
      <p class="project-tagline">Human creativity amplified through collaborative AI workflows.</p>
    </div>

    <table class="spec-table reveal">
      <tr>
        <td>Role</td>
        <td>Co-founder (side project)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Team</td>
        <td>Co-founded with two other co-founders</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Status</td>
        <td>Ongoing side project</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Website</td>
        <td><a href="https://www.bloomaut.com/" class="text-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">bloomaut.com</a></td>
      </tr>
    </table>

    <blockquote class="pull-quote reveal">
      AI assists the workflow. Humans validate the work.
    </blockquote>

    <p class="body-text reveal">
      Bloomaut is a community platform for entrepreneurs and creators who want honest, human feedback on their content before it reaches the world. We believe great content doesn't emerge from AI alone — it emerges when human creativity is refined through interaction, feedback and iteration.
    </p>
    <p class="body-text reveal">
      Most content fails not because of production quality, but because no one gave the creator honest feedback before they published. Bloomaut is the space between creation and publication: creators submit their content — especially video — to a private peer community, where real people review it and help them improve before it goes public.
    </p>
    <p class="body-text reveal">
      Our early community is entrepreneurs building thought leadership content, founders growing a personal brand through video, and creators who want real feedback before they publish. Bloomaut is co-founded by three founders, including Jose Vigil, and built on a simple belief: <em>creativity originates in mankind.</em>
    </p>

    <div class="sys-tags reveal">
      <span class="sys-tag">Content Validation</span>
      <span class="sys-tag">Community Feedback</span>
      <span class="sys-tag">Creator Tools</span>
    </div>

    <div class="sys-links reveal">
      <a href="https://www.bloomaut.com/" class="sys-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Bloomaut →</a>
      <a href="/#systems" class="sys-link">← Back to Systems</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
.project-hero {
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}
.project-hero .sec-h2 {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.project-tagline {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  max-width: 600px;
}

/* ── SPEC TABLE (verbatim from the original Paper & Ink mockup) ── */
.spec-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  margin: 2rem 0;
}
.spec-table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-light); }
.spec-table tr:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
.spec-table tr:last-child { border-bottom: 2px solid var(--rule); }
.spec-table td {
  padding: 0.55rem 1rem 0.55rem 0;
  color: var(--ink-2);
  line-height: 1.5;
}
.spec-table td:first-child {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-4);
  width: 160px;
}

/* ── TAGS / LINKS (same language as SystemsSection) ── */
.sys-tags {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
}
.sys-tag {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.52rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--ink-3);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding-bottom: 1px;
}
.sys-links {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 1.5rem;
}
.sys-link {
  font-family: var(--mono);
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--red);
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--red);
  padding-bottom: 1px;
  transition: opacity 0.2s;
}
.sys-link:hover { opacity: 0.65; }
</style>
